        "# I asked chat gpt how to make a financial tracker that allows the user to choose between typing up their income and expenses or to just upload a CSV file.\n",
        "#I followed Chat GPT's instructions.\n",
        "# Prompt:Teach me to make a python code for a finance tracker that lets me either type my budget or upload a CSV file."
      ],
